              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ; б) <span data-inline-latex=\"2\\pi\"></span> ; <span data-inline-latex=\"3\\pi\"></span> .</p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T10:34:57.617371+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ис­поль­зуя ос­нов­ной три­го­но­мет­ри­че­ское тож­де­ство и из­вле­кая квад­рат­ный ко­рень, по­лу­ча­ем:<center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{1-\\cos^{2} x}=\\sqrt{\\sin^{2} x}=\\left|\\sin x\\right|\"></span>,</p></center><p>от­ку­да по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"2024\\cdot 3^{\\left|\\sin x\\right|}-3^{\\sin x}=2023\"></span>.</p></center><p>Раз­бе­рем два слу­чая.</p><p>Если  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x\\ge 0\"></span>, то</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"2024\\cdot 3^{\\sin x}-3^{\\sin x}=2023\\iff 3^{\\sin x}=1\\iff \\sin x=0\\iff x=\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .</p></center><p>Если  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x\\le 0\"></span>, то</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"2024\\cdot 3^{-\\sin x}-3^{\\sin x}=2023\\iff 3^{2\\sin x}+2023\\cdot 3^{\\sin x}-2024=0\\iff\"></span> <br/> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}3^{\\sin x}=1\\\\3^{\\sin x}=-2024\\end{aligned}\\right..\\quad \\iff \\sin x=0\\iff x=\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .</span></p></center><p>Таким об­ра­зом, ре­ше­ни­ем урав­не­ния яв­ля­ют­ся числа  <span data-inline-latex=\"x=\\pi k,\\quad k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> .</p></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">От­бе­рем корни при по­мо­щи двой­но­го не­ра­вен­ства.<center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{3\\pi}{2}\\le \\pi k\\le \\frac{7\\pi}{2}\\iff \\frac{3}{2}\\le k\\le \\frac{7}{2}\"></span> , </p></center><p> от­ку­да <i>k</i>  =  2 или <i>k</i>  =  3. Таким об­ра­зом, на за­дан­ном от­рез­ке лежат корни <span data-inline-latex=\"2\\pi\"></span>  и <span data-inline-latex=\"3\\pi\"></span> .</p></li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
